    "note": "Track dae-. Opened as a learning log per standing preference. Two evidence sources: scikit-learn's own documented warning (verbatim) and importance_evidence.py in this folder, which reproduces the effect with a fixed seed. IMPORTANT: the reel says the ranking inverts at THREE correlated copies, not two, because that is what the experiment shows — an earlier framing claiming 'both report zero' was wrong and was corrected before authoring. Outro is HaiTitleOutro.",
